      "message": "Thanks for the patch. I tried it and found SC flag is not enough to make the pairing work.\nI have to set another 3 flags false, then the pairing works.\n\n+            p_cb-\u003eloc_auth_req \u0026\u003d ~SMP_H7_SUPPORT_BIT;\n+            p_cb-\u003elocal_i_key \u0026\u003d ~SMP_SEC_KEY_TYPE_LK;\n+            p_cb-\u003elocal_r_key \u0026\u003d ~SMP_SEC_KEY_TYPE_LK;\n\nThe AuthReq looks like the Android 12 behavior.\nSent Pairing Request: AuthReq: Bonding, MITM | Initiator Key(s): LTK, IRK, CSRK | Responder Key(s): LTK, IRK, CSRK\n\nVS Android 13:\n\nSent Pairing Request: AuthReq: Bonding, MITM, SecureConnection, Reserved | Initiator Key(s): LTK, IRK, CSRK, Linkkey | Responder Key(s): LTK, IRK, CSRK, Linkkey",
